# BuildKit honours `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the root
# `.dockerignore`. The root ignore is tuned for the *lean tool image* and drops
# tests/ and reproducibility/ — but the reproducibility capsule needs exactly
# those to regenerate the evidence base, so this ignore keeps them and excludes
# only genuinely irrelevant or non-deterministic content.
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.DS_Store
dist
build
*.egg-info
.tmp_*
# The gitignored development roadmap must never enter an image layer.
100_STEPS.md
